<title>NORWAY: DnB/Vital buy BNbank options, hold 15.2 pct.</title>
<headline>DnB/Vital buy BNbank options, hold 15.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Den norske Bank (DnB) has together with its insurance subsidiary Vital Forsikring bought the options to acquire a further 622,000 shares in niche mortgage lender Bolig og Naeringsbanken (BNbank), according to a statement on the Oslo bourse.</p>
<p>The options combined with the DnB group's previous shareholding, bring the bank's holding in BNbank to 15.2 percent, the statement said.</p>
